      "Fix": "Precede the heist with a short grounded beat \u2014 someone\u0027s mundane routine (a guard\u0027s rounds, a merchant\u0027s haggling, a commute through the city) seen by a person who has stopped being surprised by this world \u2014 before dropping into the fold-and-Sentinel action."
